SUMMARY:Generating Love
DESCRIPTION:Weekdays (Monday – Thursday)\nIn this live 25-minute meditation\, we recognize that Divine Love is within each of us. We come together in the experience of sharing and extending that love to expand a consciousness of a world that works for every one.\n\nThe Zoom link is https://tinyurl.com/GeneratingLove \n\nYou can also use a video of this meditation practice on your own at any time you choose. New video coming soon.\n\n\n\n.
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/generating-love-2022-05-04-2-2/2026-08-06/
LOCATION:Zoom
CATEGORIES:Free Events,Meditation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cslsr.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/love-scaled-e1600654727381.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Center for Spiritual Living Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T193000
DTSTAMP:20260805T204133
CREATED:20250715T231346Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250715T231346Z
UID:10006998-1786039200-1786044600@cslsr.org
SUMMARY:Joyful Frequency Song Circle
DESCRIPTION:Description: \nPresented by singer-songwriter Astra Fox\, the Joyful Frequency Song Circle is a welcoming monthly gathering where participants come together to sing simple\, uplifting songs that inspire connection\, joy\, and personal transformation. Open to all ages and experience levels\, this circle offers a fun and empowering space to explore the spiritual practice of singing affirmative songs. These songs serve as musical affirmations\, anchoring positive truths into your mind and body while building community through music. \nDetails: \n\nWhen: First Thursday of every month (except July)\, from 6 to 7:30 pm\nWhere: Social Hall at The Center for Spiritual Living\, Santa Rosa\nCost: Supported by love donations—contribute what feels right to support the circle and the center.\nWho Can Join: Open to everyone—no musical experience required\, and family-friendly!\n\n. \nJoin us to raise your vibration\, connect with your community\, and transform your thinking—one joyful note at a time.
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/joyful-frequency-song-circle/2026-08-06/
LOCATION:Center for Spiritual Living\, 2075 Occidental Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95410\, United States
CATEGORIES:Free Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cslsr.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/song-circle-musical-notes.jpg
GEO:38.43058;-122.745975
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Center for Spiritual Living 2075 Occidental Road Santa Rosa CA 95410 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2075 Occidental Road:geo:-122.745975,38.43058
END:VEVENT
