SUMMARY:Young Adult Group
DESCRIPTION:Looking to spend time in spirituality with your fellow young adults? Look no further than our Young Adults group that meets on the first Thursday from 7 to 8:30 PM every month at the Center. \nIn it you will make new friends\, share in spiritual practice together\, and support one another on your individual spiritual journeys. \nRegister for the group below. We look forward to seeing you! \nhttps://cslsr.breezechms.com/form/YAGroup \n 
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/young-adult-group/2026-08-06/
LOCATION:Center for Spiritual Living\, CA
CATEGORIES:Groups
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://cslsr.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Add-a-heading-7.png
GEO:38.43058;-122.745975
END:VEVENT
